OL,3,GNEWSAPalantir drops City Hall legal
OL,4,Afight over Met deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FPalantir has dropped its High Court
OL,7,Fchallenge against the mayor of London's
OL,8,Fpolicing office over a blocked #50m
OL,9,Fdeal with the Metropolitan Police.
OL,11,FHowever, the Mayor's Office for
OL,12,FPolicing and Crime (MOPAC) has not
OL,13,Freversed its decision to stop the Met
OL,14,Fagreeing a two-year software contract
OL,15,Fwith the US technology firm.
OL,17,FInstead, in a joint statement on
OL,18,FWednesday, it said the decision was
OL,19,F"not based on Palantir's values or
OL,20,Fethics" and that the company was "free
OL,21,Fand welcomed" to bid when the contract
OL,22,Fis re-run.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
