OL,3,GNEWSAPalantir drops City Hall legal
OL,4,Afight over Met deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mayor's office said neither side
OL,7,Fhad made any payment to the other and
OL,8,Fboth would pay their own legal costs.
